# WarriorCast2SkillsApproachAggressive (18329, a hall keeper captain of the Frintezza raid): a dying
# captain tells the NPCs within 5000 (script event 0, arg1 10037), and a captain that heard nine
# captains die drops a Dewdrop of Destruction (8556) for its killer instead. Nine kills of the
# fallen captain (each kill a fresh one at the same point) leave the survivor 40 away dropping the
# dewdrop on its own kill; the fallen captain drops none.
character Hunter 20
random always 99
item 8556
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCast2SkillsApproachAggressive
npc fallen 18329 Monster 40 0 0
npc survivor 18329 Monster 80 0 0

kill fallen x9
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
kill survivor
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  S DropItem by=survivor item=8556 count=1 stackable=1 animate=1
